{"id": "85913", "name": "אינטגרל לא מסוים מיידי – sin(nx) או cos(nx) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Integrate {{CT:0}} with respect to {{CT:1}}.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">A linear substitution</b><br><p>Put \\(u={{CT:2}}\\). Then \\(du={{CT:3}}\\,d{{CT:4}}\\), that is \\(d{{CT:4}}=\\frac{du}{{CT:3}}\\), so</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:5}}\\,d{{CT:4}} = \\frac{1}{{CT:3}}\\int {{CT:6}}\\,du = \\frac{1}{{CT:3}}\\left({{CT:7}}\\right) + C. \\]</p><p>Substituting back \\(u={{CT:2}}\\):</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:5}}\\,d{{CT:4}} = {{CT:8}} + C \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "all